{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "By now I probably know at least a dozen different recipes. Mind you, they're easier on the wallet than the taste buds.": "",
  "Haha, well it sounds like what you're saying is, being able  to make good curry doesn't necessarily make you a good cook.": "",
  "(Crap, she's right... What am I saying?)": "",
  "So what are your hobbies, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Hmm, if I had to choose one, I think it'd be... pinball. I'm practically obsessed with it.": "",
  "Pinball? Is that any fun?": "",
  "Definitely. It's one of those easy to learn, hard to master sorts of things. Want to try it out sometime?": "",
  "Wait, you actually <font_kind=yakuza_italic>have</font_kind> a pinball machine?": "",
  "Yeah. I found it online, and since it was on sale, I knew I had to swoop up on it before anyone else did...": "",
  "But when it arrived, the damn thing was way larger than I expected. So I had no idea where to put it... I still don't.": "",
  "Sounds like it'll be a pain in the butt to move if you ever get too bored of it.": "",
  "I know, right? I practically bump into it every time I need to go to my desk, plus I already have pinball on my phone.": "",
  "I kick myself in the ass for buying that old hunk of junk sometimes. It's like, \"Get your shit together, past self!\"": "",
  "...Hehe. I didn't know you had such a childish side, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Well, I wouldn't exactly call it that...": "",
  "Hey, it's cute. And besides... I wouldn't mind coming over and playing with that old hunk of junk of yours sometime.": "",
  "...You're more than welcome to.": "",
  "(Thank you, sweet pinball machine! I knew you were good for more than collecting dust!)": "",
  "Coming up with cheap recipes, maybe?": "",
  "Oh, you can cook too?": "",
  "Yeah. My basic cooking strategy is to think up the most filling, delicious, and cost-effective dishes imaginable.": "",
  "Huh, now that's an idea. I don't have much money myself, so please do elaborate.": "",
  "Sure. Let me think of an example...": "",
  "Okay, so if you fry tofu in lard and sprinkle it with yakiniku sauce... Voila! It actually tastes like meat.": "",
  "Not only is it healthy, it's cheap! So that's one of my favorite recommendations.": "",
  "Hehe, sounds like an easy-to-make steak! Oh, I bet putting melted cheese on it would be good, too!": "",
  "That does sound good. It's even better if you cook it with a little bit of miso until it's slightly burnt.": "",
  "Mmm, I can almost taste it now!": "",
  "Got any other recipes for me?": "",
  "How about a tenkasu bowl? Trust me, it's not as bad as it sounds.": "",
  "Tenkasu? You mean those crunchy little tempura flakes?": "",
  "Precisely. If you want the tempura bowl flavor without the tempura bowl price...": "",
  "All you need to do is top of a bowl of rice with tenkasu, add your soy sauce, and you're done!": "",
  "The nice thing is, tenkasu's really cheap. Sometimes even free. Though I guess it's not very nutritious, huh...": "",
  "Yeah... I don't think I'd wanna try that any time soon.": "",
  "Well, this isn't really something I recommend, but...": "",
  "But? Go on.": "",
  "Bring a plain onigiri to a department store, then eat it while trying out all the different food samples they have.": "",
  "As long as you don't mind the risk of getting caught, or throwing away your dignity, you can get real full this way.": "",
  "You're not being serious, are you?": "",
  "Heh. That's why I said I couldn't recommend it.": "",
  "Come on, don't tease me like that...": "",
  "That's all I can think of so far.": "",
  "You... get into fights with people?": "",
  "More like I get harassed the moment I step out the door. It's getting pretty bad...": "",
  "On my worst days, I get into an average of three fights every fifty meters. It's just punk after punk after punk.": "",
  "No way... I mean, I know this is Kamurocho and all, but seriously? You fight that much?": "",
  "Yup. There are some crazy people out there who, for one reason or another, want to beat me black and blue. Or worse.": "",
  "And no matter how much I try to talk them down, they never listen. So I have to use a little... self-defense.": "",
  "But I'm telling you, they're like roaches. Step on one, and ten more take their place.": "",
  "O... Okay. I wouldn't really call that a hobby, though.": "",
  "I dunno, Sana-chan... I am kinda starting to enjoy it.": "",
  "Wow, Yagami-san... You're more of a bad boy than I gave you credit for.": "",
  "So what kind of guys are you into, Sana-chan?": "",
  "Wow, that sure came out of nowhere! ...Why do you ask?": "",
  "I was just curious.": "",
  "Hmm... In that case...": "",
  "My lips are sealed!": "",
  "...Really.": "",
  "(I bet she would tell me if I pushed for it...)": "",
  "(Guess that's a dead end. I'll ask her something else for now.)": "",
  "Hmm, now that's a question...": "",
  "It's kinda hard to say.": "",
  "Okay, how about older or younger? Which do you prefer?": "",
  "...Mm, I'd say older. I want someone dependable, you know?": "",
  "Yeah, I can respect that.": "",
  "What about you? Do you tend to date younger or older?": "",
  "Younger for me.": "",
  "Oh really? Then...": "",
  "How much younger?": "",
  "Well, I'm 35 right now, so...": "",
  "Oh, and do note that I'm 19.": "",
  "Hint hint, I could probably go 20 years up! ❤": "",
  "I'd say 5 years down is my limit. So, about 30 years old.": "",
  "Whaaat, that's it?": "",
  "There's no way you'd go... any younger?": "",
  "Well, I doubt we'd have much in common. I mean, what would we even talk about?": "",
  "Aww... So that's how you feel when you're talking to me?": "",
  "Oh, no, that's not what I was trying to say.": "",
  "Aha! Then you'd be okay with 15 years younger after all! Y'know, 'cause we get along so well?": "",
  "Haha. Guess you got me there.": "",
  "Hmm... I'd say 15 years. I'm pretty flexible, you know.": "",
  "That means you'd go as low as... 20? Hey, that's almost my age!": "",
  "But... would it really be so easy to bridge that kind of age gap?": "",
  "Well, what about us? We can pretty much talk about anything, right? Maybe we were meant for each other.": "",
  "...Oh, I get it. You almost had me for a second there. You're silly, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I dunno. 20 years, maybe?": "",
  "20? Wait, if you're going younger, that means... You would date... a 15-year-old?": "",
  "Hell no! Sorry, I kind of just... blurted that out without thinking. There's no way I'd do something like that.": "",
  "Of course you wouldn't! Geez, don't scare me like that.": "",
  "I like my ladies mature. You know, a little on the older side.": "",
  "Oh... okay. Whatever floats your boat, Yagami-san.": "",
  "So, how do you like Kamurocho? Used to the big city by now?": "",
  "I think so. At first I was intimidated by all the people here, but I realized a lot of them are actually pretty nice.": "",
  "You do have a lot of fans looking out for you. Including me.": "",
  "Just don't forget to be careful. There are plenty of shady characters around here looking for an easy target, too.": "",
  "Take the... Keihin Gang, I think is what they're called. Basically a bunch of clowns dressed up as gangsters.": "",
  "...Oh, I know them! They're actually pretty nice.": "",
  "What? Did you say <font_kind=yakuza_italic>nice</font_kind>?": "",
  "Sure did. In fact, they used to give me the creeps, but now they come and cheer for me every time I sing. Neat, huh?": "",
  "...Sana-chan, you never cease to amaze me. There really is a lot of power in your music.": "",
  "Hehe. There's even this one guy... What's his name? Kasai-san? He's definitely my most... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>eccentric</font_kind> admirer.": "",
  "Kasai, huh... I've heard that name before.": "",
  "Well, have you heard he's the leader of my cheering squad?": "",
  "He brings his whole crew with him—dressed in pink happi, mind you—and they practically cheer for me nonstop!": "",
  "That... sounds scary as shit. I'm happy for you though.": "",
  "Do keep in mind that Kamurocho caters specifically to adults with certain... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>desires</font_kind>. You sure you can handle the pressure?": "",
  "I can handle it just fine. I'm not a little girl, you know.": "",
  "I didn't say you were, but legally, you're barely of age. You're not worried about the cops breaking up your set?": "",
  "Well, I'm an adult now, so I'd like to see them try!": "",
  "(Crap, I didn't think I'd actually make her <font_kind=yakuza_italic>mad</font_kind>.)": "",
  "I'm sorry if I offended you in some way. But I had to at least say something.": "",
  "I know this city like the back of my hand.": "",
  "Okay... And why are you telling me this?": "",
  "Well, you know... When you end up learning the ins and outs of a city, that's how you really know you're an adult.": "",
  "Oh, all right then... I'll be sure to work on that.": "",
  "(Dang. That didn't sound nearly as cool as it did in my head.)": "",
  "Hey, how about we take a picture? Our future selves will thank us.": "",
  "Oh, of course!": "",
  "Yup. Looks just fine to me.": "",
  "Wow, you're actually pretty good! Can you send this to me later?": "",
  "Hmm. Not quite feeling it. Can we do this one over?": "",
  "Hey, look. That's the girl from all those videos going around...": "",
  "Oh yeah. \"The Songstress of Kamurocho,\" right?": "",
  "Yep, and she's damn cute, too. Wonder if she's dating that guy.": "",
  "They're really talking you up there, huh?": "",
  "I guess...": "",
  "Come to think of it, those videos of yours have gotten pretty popular lately.": "",
  "Yes, well. I'm glad that people like my music, but at the same time... I can't help feeling a bit overwhelmed...": "",
  "Should we get going, then?": "",
  "I... think so. I've had enough publicity for one day.": "",
  "You know... you sure are something. It's like you became an overnight celebrity.": "",
  "Well, I certainly never expected it to happen so quickly...": "",
  "Who would have thought a couple of live performances in front of Theater Square would get me this far?": "",
  "Hey, people like what they like. And personally, I think they see something special in you. That's what draws them in.": "",
  "Well, I'm certainly happy to hear that. But it's... I don't know... scary? To have so much attention all of a sudden...": "",
  "Maybe a talent agent would help keep things under control? I'm sure there are some good ones out there.": "",
  "I do plan on asking one, if I meet the right person.": "",
  "Call me if you run into any trouble.": "",
  "...Okay. I will.": "",
  "Thanks for taking me out today, Yagami-san! I had a lot of fun.": "",
  "My pleasure. I had a good time too.": "",
  "You know... it's funny. Time always goes so fast whenever I'm with you.": "",
  "...I'm glad we could spend the whole day together.": "",
  "So am I. Guess I'll be seeing you later then?": "",
  "Sure! Oh, and text me sometime, okay?": "",
  "Thanks for today, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'm a little burned out...": "",
  "(Things didn't go so smooth today. I must have messed up somehow...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, you came!": "",
  "Of course. I promised, didn't I?": "",
  "Hehe. You're such a sweetie.": "",
  "*sob* I... I just don't know how to feel... I mean, I am happy for Sana-chan, but... oh, the pangs of jealousy!": "",
  "...Lucky bastard.": "",
  "Sorry to keep you waiting, Yagami-san!": "",
  "No problem. More importantly, congrats on your big debut!": "",
  "(Now, where should we go today?)": "",
  "Do you want to try the batting center again?": "",
  "Sure! Hope I do better than last time.": "",
  "Do you want to play darts again?": "",
  "Yeah, and I don't plan on losing this time!": "",
  "How about the arcade?": "",
  "Works for me! Let's get a plushie!": "",
  "...Greetings, Songstress of Kamurocho.": "",
  "Oh, um. Hi there, Kabata-san.": "",
  "So I heard you're finally signing with a label... I see you've done very well for yourself.": "",
  "Uh, thank you?": "",
  "Of course. Still looking beautiful as ever, I see.": "",
  "Hehe. You know, I even bought a new phone just to take your picture. Even the oil in your pores'll show up on this thing!": "",
  "Um... eww?": "",
  "By the way... Who's this you're hanging out with?": "",
  "Ah... That would be...": "",
  "Just a friend.": "",
  "Hunh. *snort* Nice jacket you got there. Where'd you get it? Janky... jackets... for jackasses dot com?": "",
  "(...Wow.)": "",
  "Speaking of websites, I made you a Sana-chan fan shrine. You should check it out!": "",
  "I'm pretty much your biggest admirer, so... Could I, like, have your contact information? So I could send you the URL.": "",
  "Thanks, but... I'd rather not give that out.": "",
  "Don't worry, I promise not to share it with anyone weird. And I'll make sure not to bother you late at night... much.": "",
  "Yeah, so I don't mean to interrupt, but we were on our way somewhere. But thank you for voicing your support.": "",
  "That guy just now. Is he also one of your fans?": "",
  "Kabata-san? Yeah, he's been one of my biggest supporters since I was just a country gal experimenting with music.": "",
  "I mean, sure, his fan letters are a bit... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>passionate</font_kind> at times. And yes, he does seem odd, but he's not a bad person.": "",
  "Hope I didn't give him the wrong impression.": "",
  "Well, what if he... I dunno, thought we were dating? Wouldn't that hurt your image as an up-and-coming singer?": "",
  "I... could see how that makes sense.": "",
  "Grabbing something to eat in public doesn't seem like such a hot idea anymore. What if we run into more of his kind?": "",
  "Aww, then our day's totally ruined! I was so looking forward to it, too...": "",
  "Yeah, I know...": "",
  "In that case, how about we head to my place?": "",
  "You mean...?": "",
  "Yeah. We won't have to worry about anyone seeing us there.": "",
  "Wait... Are you saying you want to...?": "",
  "Does this mean what I think it does!?": "",
  "Uh, what I meant was, why don't we head over to my office? I also happen to live there, so...": "",
  "Just think of it as stopping by my workplace.": "",
  "Oh... that makes sense. Okay then.": "",
  "(Yeah, so that wasn't awkward at all...)": "",
  "Already? No, not really.": "",
  "I was kind of hoping we could talk.": "",
  "(Well, in that case...)": "",
  "So this is your home office?": "",
  "It's actually pretty stylish... I like it!": "",
  "Thanks. I try and spiff it up for my clients every now and then.": "",
  "Isn't there supposed to be a bed somewhere, though? Since you live here and all.": "",
  "Ah, I just sleep on the sofa. Saves space, saves money, saves time.": "",
  "Hehe. You're silly... not to mention a bit <font_kind=yakuza_italic>wild</font_kind>.": "",
  "Speaking of being wild... I forgot to forage for food. Literally, there's nothing in the fridge. Some host I am...": "",
  "Oh, that's okay...": "",
  "Actually... I was thinking that maybe I could cook for you.": "",
  "...Would you?": "",
  "Sure. I can make you pretty much anything as long as I have the ingredients.": "",
  "Yeah? Well then I'll be right back!": "",
  "Want me to go with you?": "",
  "(I can't help but feel a little bad about this...)": "",
  "You look worried, Yagami-san! Don't be, I enjoy this!": "",
  "Ta-da! All done!": "",
  "W-Whoa!": "",
  "It's my special curry, made with an extra dash of dashi to give it that unique Japanese flavor. Hope you like it!": "",
  "You have no idea how much I appreciate this.": "",
  "(Hmm... I bought so much random stuff... What all did she use to make this?)": "",
  "(I can tell she added mirin to the base. And this vegetable here... Is this daikon radish?)": "",
  "(Then there's the chicken. It's soft, it's moist, and full of natural curry spice flavor.)": "",
  "(And normally, I'd think that curry and dashi would clash, but Sana-chan managed to give them an even balance.)": "",
  "(I gotta let her know how I feel about this dish.)": "",
  "Mm-mm-mmm!": "",
  "Is it... good?": "",
  "It's not just good—it's delicious!": "",
  "Oh yeah. It's mouth-watering. Mind-blowing. Life-changing, even!": "",
  "You... like it that much?": "",
  "No, I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>love</font_kind> it that much. Even the inventor of curry could probably learn a thing or two from you!": "",
  "Yay! I'm so glad you're enjoying it, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey, this is pretty good. It's got a nice kick to it.": "",
  "Oh, thank goodness!": "",
  "I tried to give it more of a traditional Japanese flavor, so I wasn't sure if you'd be into it or not.": "",
  "You did well. It's perfect in every way.": "",
  "Hehe, then I'm glad I made it!": "",
  "I can tell you put a lot of effort into this... And don't get me wrong, it is well-made and everything...": "",
  "In fact, everyone you serve it to will probably eat it up and ask for seconds...": "",
  "...Except for me. I'm not really a big fan. It's more of a personal preference thing... Kinda hard to explain.": "",
  "Oh... It's my recipe, isn't it? I thought you'd appreciate something a little different... but I guess not. Sorry.": "",
  "Well, I do appreciate you being adventurous. What with you being my guest and deciding to cook for me and all.": "",
  "You are good at cooking, I'll definitely give you that. Next time, maybe ask the other person's preferences first?": "",
  "Mhm... *sniffle* Okay...": "",
  "(Oh no. What did I just do? Did I just make a sweet girl who made her special curry for me... cry?)": "",
  "You know what? Forget what I said, I realize that came across as really rude. I'm thankful you gave me your best.": "",
  "No, it's fine. I'm glad you're comfortable enough with me to share your honest feelings.": "",
  "The mature thing to do is take it as a learning experience instead of getting frustrated. Which doesn't solve anything.": "",
  "So... thanks for being straightforward with me, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(What a positive thing to say... With an attitude like that, she'll definitely go far in life.)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Oh, of course!": "อ้อ แน่นอนอยู่แล้ว!",
  "I guess...": "ก็...คงงั้นครับ...",
  "You mean...?": "ลุงหมายความว่า...?",
  "W-Whoa!": "ว-โห!"
 }
}
